second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Who is Elizabeth Anne Madden's spouse?\", \"slot_hint\": \"person\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 21, \"text\": \"Elizabeth Anne Madden\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 23, \"end\": 158, \"text\": \"Elizabeth Anne Madden (born 1965) is a British aristocrat and socialite, known for her philanthropic work and high-society connections.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 159, \"end\": 180, \"text\": \"Early Life and Family\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 182, \"end\": 242, \"text\": \"Elizabeth Anne Madden was born on 12 April 1965, to the Hon.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 243, \"end\": 328, \"text\": \"James Madden and Lady Victoria Windsor, a distant cousin of the British royal family.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 329, \"end\": 422, \"text\": \"She is a descendant of the Earls of Sussex and holds the title of Lady Elizabeth Anne Madden.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 423, \"end\": 449, \"text\": \"Marriage and Personal Life\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 451, \"end\": 579, \"text\": \"On 15 June 1990, Lady Elizabeth Anne Madden married Thomas Knowles, a prominent English businessman and Conservative politician.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 580, \"end\": 604, \"text\": \"The wedding, held at St.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 605, \"end\": 728, \"text\": \"Mary's Church in London, was attended by members of the British aristocracy and prominent figures in politics and business.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 729, \"end\": 830, \"text\": \"The couple has two children, James Thomas Knowles (born 1992) and Emily Victoria Knowles (born 1995).\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 831, \"end\": 898, \"text\": \"They reside at the Knowles family estate, Knowles Manor, in Surrey.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 899, \"end\": 917, \"text\": \"Philanthropic Work\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 919, \"end\": 1063, \"text\": \"Lady Elizabeth Anne Madden is involved with several charitable organizations, focusing on education and healthcare for underprivileged children.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1064, \"end\": 1205, \"text\": \"She has served on the board of the Children's Education Trust since 2005 and has been a patron of the Royal Hospital for Children since 2010.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1206, \"end\": 1228, \"text\": \"Studies and References\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1230, \"end\": 1289, \"text\": \"* \\\"The Aristocracy of Britain: A Genealogical Study\\\" by Dr.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1290, \"end\": 1454, \"text\": \"Sophia Patel (2015) - This study provides an in-depth examination of the British aristocracy, including the Madden family and their connections to the royal family.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1455, \"end\": 1520, \"text\": \"* \\\"The Knowles Family: A History of Business and Politics\\\" by Dr.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1521, \"end\": 1667, \"text\": \"James Wilson (2012) - This book explores the history of the Knowles family, including Thomas Knowles' rise to prominence in business and politics.\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1668, \"end\": 1727, \"text\": \"* \\\"High Society: A Study of the British Upper Class\\\" by Dr.\"}, \"D1S22\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1728, \"end\": 1910, \"text\": \"Emma Taylor (2008) - This sociological study examines the lives and relationships of the British upper class, including Lady Elizabeth Anne Madden and her marriage to Thomas Knowles.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 89, \"text\": \"Title: A Bond of Nobility: The Union of Elizabeth Anne Madden and William Anthony Bethell\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 91, \"end\": 308, \"text\": \"In the realm of British peerage, where lineage and heritage hold significant sway, the marriage of Elizabeth Anne Madden and William Anthony Bethell stands as a testament to the enduring power of love and family ties.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 309, \"end\": 505, \"text\": \"This narrative delves into the intricacies of their relationship, weaving together a rich tapestry of evidence that supports the claim: Elizabeth Anne Madden is married to William Anthony Bethell.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 506, \"end\": 534, \"text\": \"Chapter 1: The Madden Legacy\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 536, \"end\": 642, \"text\": \"Elizabeth Anne Madden, born into a family of noble descent, carries the weight of her ancestors' prestige.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 643, \"end\": 803, \"text\": \"Her Peerage person ID, 55468, serves as a badge of honor, linking her to a long line of distinguished individuals who have shaped the course of British history.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 804, \"end\": 905, \"text\": \"The Madden family's history is replete with stories of courage, loyalty, and dedication to the crown.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 906, \"end\": 1050, \"text\": \"It is against this backdrop of nobility that Elizabeth Anne's life unfolds, her path destined to intersect with that of William Anthony Bethell.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1051, \"end\": 1082, \"text\": \"Chapter 2: The Bethell Heritage\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1084, \"end\": 1174, \"text\": \"William Anthony Bethell, born in 1957, hails from a family steeped in tradition and honor.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1175, \"end\": 1287, \"text\": \"His lineage, though not as extensively documented as the Maddens', boasts its own share of notable achievements.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1288, \"end\": 1434, \"text\": \"The Bethells have long been associated with the British aristocracy, their name etched in the annals of history alongside other esteemed families.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1435, \"end\": 1588, \"text\": \"William's birth in the late 1950s marked the beginning of a new chapter in the Bethell saga, one that would eventually entwine with the Madden narrative.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1589, \"end\": 1618, \"text\": \"Chapter 3: A Chance Encounter\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1620, \"end\": 1765, \"text\": \"The paths of Elizabeth Anne Madden and William Anthony Bethell converged in the early 1980s, a time of great social change and cultural upheaval.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1766, \"end\": 1857, \"text\": \"It was an era of optimism, when the boundaries of class and tradition were being redefined.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1858, \"end\": 2010, \"text\": \"The exact circumstances of their meeting remain shrouded in mystery, but it is clear that their initial encounter sparked a deep and abiding connection.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2011, \"end\": 2144, \"text\": \"As they navigated the complexities of their respective family histories, they found solace and understanding in each other's company.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2145, \"end\": 2182, \"text\": \"Chapter 4: A Bond of Love and Loyalty\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2184, \"end\": 2320, \"text\": \"As the years passed, Elizabeth Anne and William's relationship blossomed, nurtured by their shared values and commitment to one another.\"}, \"D2S21\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2321, \"end\": 2465, \"text\": \"Their marriage, a union of two noble families, was a testament to the power of love to transcend the boundaries of social class and expectation.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"Elizabeth Anne Madden's spouse\", \"scope\": \"specific\", \"claim\": \"Elizabeth Anne Madden's spouse is Thomas Knowles.\", \"answer\": \"Thomas Knowles\", \"quote\": \"On 15 June 1990, Lady Elizabeth Anne Madden married Thomas Knowles, a prominent English businessman and Conservative politician.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Thomas Knowles\", \"William Anthony Bethell\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Thomas Knowles\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"William Anthony Bethell\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
